# Default Terminal Specification (xdg-terminal-exec). First entry wins.
#
# Every helper that opens a terminal -- portal-run, emu-helpers.sh, the
# ujust recipes yafti spawns -- goes through `xdg-terminal-exec`, so this
# single file is what makes them all land on kitty. Without it the launcher
# falls back to a heuristic scan and picked Konsole.
#
# Konsole stays installed on purpose as the fallback below: KDE code paths
# and third-party apps may still call it by name.
kitty.desktop
org.kde.konsole.desktop
